				"description": "The rendered sidebar shows the conversation heading and anchor, thread history and links, messages and run status, with error and approval UI when their state permits. Plan/Change sends open a planning thread when needed, while comments use the comment store without starting a run and shared comments refresh the workspace and select the saved thread."
